kind: round
id: round

[words jam]
title: "Who Put the Jam in My Top Hat?"
"Who put the jam in my top hat"
"Pass me the toast and hide the cat"
"My socks can dance my shoes can squeak"
"We sing in rounds all through the week"
last: "Jam"

[words key]
title: "I Found a Key"
"I found a key that fits no door"
"It hums a tune it learned from you"
"So ask it twice and ask it nice"
"It turns the lock and lets us through"
last: "Click"

[words toast]
title: "The Toast Knows a Thing"
"Toast pops up with a fact or two"
"Warm and kind and a smidge burnt through"
"Ask the old lamp to light the way"
"Not quite wise but it tries all day"
last: "Ding"

[words studio]
title: "Studio Four Oh Four!"
"Plug the cord in turn the dial bright"
"Hertz shows snow while green eyes blink white"
"Tap two keys and start the tape show"
"Four oh four plays fast and spins slow"
last: "Four"
